# Obsidian app/plugin state — minified JS, not knowledge.
# Keeps `mempalace mine` from filing plugin bundles as drawers (lesson: 2026-09-02,
# the kinoite vault's .obsidian tree would have filed 13,881 junk drawers).
.obsidian/
.trash/

# Local review recovery copies.
.note-review-backups/

# Raw --help dumps: a lookup appendix, not knowledge.
# 4,800 lines of flag text out-scores the curated notes on bm25 and dilutes
# semantic retrieval (verified 2026-09-02: a query about atuin scripts hit
# just's help dump). Files stay in the vault to READ; they are kept out of
# the palace so `mempalace search` returns the written notes.
40 Reference/help/
